  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Request path",
      "items": [
        "FastAPI replaced Pyramid (#2365): web/ routes call the unchanged views/ logic",
        "gunicorn runs uvicorn workers; each worker serves server.threads requests at once",
        "Reads go through dogpile caches in Redis; writes notify the syncer after commit",
        "Searches query ES for ids, then load the documents from PostgreSQL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Recent changes (since Sept 2026)",
      "items": [
        "Map overlays /outings/map/heatmap and /map/tracks (on master, after v6.33.1); TRACKS_OVERLAY_ENABLED and TRACKS_OVERLAY_MAX_TRACKS",
        "GET /users/token lets c2c_tracking check that a token was not revoked",
        "Tokens and SSO keys stored as SHA-256 hashes",
        "discourse.enabled = false runs the API without a forum (preprod)",
        "Route suggestions from a GPS track, /users/partners, forum comment topics renamed and watched",
        "The syncer reads only the changed documents; Python 3.15 and uv"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Elasticsearch",
      "items": [
        "master still uses the elasticsearch 2.4 client",
        "The ES 8 client is PR #2550, run on preprod as the es8-preprod image tag",
        "The API reaches ES through HAProxy :9200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not drawn",
      "items": [
        "alembic migrations and initialize_c2corg_api_es / fill_es_index, run by hand",
        "reCAPTCHA check on registration; Navitia journeys proxied by views/navitia.py (job state in Redis)",
        "Anonymous rate limiting in Redis; the scheduler also logs expired users out of the forum"
      ]
    }
  ]
}